"text": "If the task requires selecting the category with the highest current labeled rating share, and the chart shows Design at 52%, Support at 45%, Delivery at 39%, Other at 32%, Quality at 24%, and Price at 10%, then Design is the category with the highest current labeled rating share.",
"component": "numeric decoding",
"conditions": "The printed percentage labels are the 'labeled rating share' values, and the task's 'highest' refers to the maximum of these values."
},
{
"id": "r3",
"text": "If the form's primary field 'Product feedback follow-up category' requires selecting the category with the highest current labeled rating share, and the chart shows Design at 52% as the highest, then the correct action is to select 'Select Design'.",
